 "rules": [
  {
   "title": "Regelmatig: stam, stam + t, infinitief",
   "text": "Take -en off the infinitive to get the stem, and fix the spelling: wonen → woon, stoppen → stop. ik takes the stem; jij, u, hij/zij/het add -t; wij, jullie, zij (plural) use the infinitive.",
